  "title": "Kvartira ijaraga olish",
  "title_de": "Eine Wohnung mieten",
  "goal": "Dars oxirida ijara e'lonini tushuna olasiz (Miete, Nebenkosten, Kaution), uy egasiga savol bera olasiz va \"gefallen, gehören, helfen\" fe'llari bilan Dativni to'g'ri ishlatasiz (Die Wohnung gefällt mir).",
  "skill_focus": [
    "vocabulary",
    "grammar",
    "reading"
  ],
  "explanation": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Germaniyada kvartira ijarasi ikki qismdan iborat: \"Kaltmiete\" (sof ijara haqi) va \"Nebenkosten\" (suv, isitish, chiqindi va h.k.). Ikkalasi birga — \"Warmmiete\". Ko'chib kirishda odatda \"Kaution\" (garov puli, ko'pincha 3 oylik sof ijara) to'lanadi."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Dativ — o'zbek tilidagi jo'nalish kelishigiga (-ga) o'xshaydi: \"kimga? nimaga?\" = \"wem?\". Masalan: \"Kalit uy egasiga tegishli\" → \"Der Schlüssel gehört dem Vermieter\"."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "",
        "Nominativ",
        "Dativ",
        "Misol"
      ],
